    "body": "Yes, you're right.\n\nThis raises an interesting question. When we fetch a module script tree for a worker, what fetch client should we use for fetching `import`ed modules? The outside one, or the inside one? The outside one was used for fetching the original module, but the inside one seems more like the thing that actually initiated the fetch.\n",
